+
+CLARIFIER (Anjali) - clarifier.py is ONE standalone file: copy it into any project, it needs nothing else.
+  How to use it anywhere: see the top of clarifier.py (3 lines: Clarifier(), then step() per message).
+  It keeps asking until the request is complete (no fixed limit). Ways out: danger words -> SOS offer,
+  "never mind" -> cancel, a new question -> handled normally. Every 3rd question reminds "just say help".
+  Questions are written by the AI when one is available, checked for safety, with built-in backups.
+
+  In JARVIS it is wired in through small hooks marked "CLARIFIER":
+  agents.py          ClarifierAgent: a thin adapter that calls clarifier.plan()
+                     tools take asks={param: question}: the Clarifier asks it when that detail is missing
+                     action agents reply "NEED_DETAILS: tool.param" instead of guessing a missing detail
