+  orchestrator.py    Router.plan: keyword danger / missing details go to the clarifier first
+                     Router.ask_jev: one extra Jev question, is_danger (same call, no extra request)
+                     run_chain(): an agent missing a detail goes straight to the clarifier;
+                                  the clarifier is not safety-gated (it has no tools, only asks)
+                     handle(): merges the user's answer into the request, sets up the SOS yes/no
+                     Router.keyword(): zero word overlap now asks instead of picking the first agent
+  providers.py       Claude replies: keep only text blocks (thinking blocks crashed every call)
+  config.py          sos_agent, danger_floor (the Clarifier's own settings are at the top of clarifier.py)
+
+  python test_clarifier.py          23 tests of clarifier.py on its own (no other files, no keys)
+  python test_clarifier_jarvis.py   21 tests of the Clarifier inside JARVIS (mock mode, no keys)
